<title>USA: Fresh Choice names Jefferson president.</title>
<headline>Fresh Choice names Jefferson president.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh Choice Inc said Everett Jefferson was named president and chief executive officer of Fresh Choice, effective immediately. He succeeds Robert Ferngren, who resigned to join another business.</p>
</text>
